{
  "lesson": 2,
  "heading": "ஆங்கில மொழிபெயர்ப்பு",
  "lines": [
    "The flame-red ambal",
    "in their slushy ponds",
    "open their petalled mouths.",
    "The birds arise from their perches",
    "and, mistaking the flowering",
    "for a wild fire, catching,",
    "hide in their wings",
    "their little ones, crackling.",
    "No other fear,",
    "no other noise",
    "here troubles the life",
    "in the care of spear-wielding Kotai. - M.Bhoopathi"
  ]
}